      "paragraphs": [
        "The Blue Jays close the book on their season this afternoon at Rogers Centre, with Max Scherzer set for the finale against the Reds at 3:07 p.m. ET on Sportsnet. Toronto was beaten 5-1 last night, so this one carries the last sharp edge of October that never quite arrived.",
        "The Leafs are back on home watch now, with Tuesday's season opener against the Canadiens on Sportsnet at 7 p.m. ET, and the Raptors keep building toward camp with a preseason date against the Heat on Oct. 3 before the Bulls visit on Oct. 21. Down in Washington, the Commanders meet the Seahawks at 1 p.m. ET on FOX, and Jayden Daniels remains the central name after a week of outside noise around his surgery decision."
